OL,3,AWoman in Cornell University rape case
OL,4,Awas 'failed at every turn', New York
OL,5,Agovernor says
OL,6,
OL,7,FNew York Governor Kathy Hochul says the
OL,8,Fwoman at the centre of the Cornell
OL,9,FUniversity rape case was "failed" at
OL,10,F"every turn"
OL,12,FThe case was reopened after the woman
OL,13,Ffiled a civil lawsuit last month,
OL,14,Falleging she was drugged and raped by
OL,15,Fseven men at a fraternity house in 2024
OL,17,FGiving an update, Hochul says she is
OL,18,F"deeply disturbed" by the handling of
OL,19,Fthe case and that she won't allow it
OL,20,F"to be swept under the rug" - here's
OL,21,Fwhat else we heard
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
